<div class="b" style="margin-left:7.69%;width:83.87%;margin-top:12px"><div class="rt"><p class="ff-serif fs-20 c-27223e"><strong>Benno Spieker</strong></p></div></div>
<div class="b" style="margin-left:7.69%;width:76.92%;margin-top:20px"><div class="rt"><p class="ff-sans fs-14 c-27223e lh-140">Interactive educational technology supporting joint music playing in general music education to children (4-12 years)</p></div></div>
